{"src":"ur","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":171200,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ur","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8641.176475999999,"text":"تاہم شنجن کا علاقہ اس سلسلے میں کسی حد تک ایک ملک کی طرح کام کرتا ہے"},{"kind":"text","t":9172.374977,"text":"However, the Shenzhen area functions to some extent like a country in this regard."},{"kind":"audio","t":9272.107958999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9277.002337999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9282.162972999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9287.578753,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":9288.044334999999,"samples":9328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":15941.868836999998,"text":"یہ گار جو مکھے کے شمال کے پہاڑ کی چوٹی پر واقع ہے باقی دنیا سے کاملا الگ تھلگ ہے"},{"kind":"text","t":16709.530738999998,"text":"This garrison, located on the summit of Mount Beeh’s North, is completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":16801.588118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":16806.101353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16811.588332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":16816.791707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16822.171488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16825.495743,"samples":23360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":25031.681937999998,"text":"لوگ آج کل پیغامات کمپیوٹر اسکریم پر لکھتے ہیں انہیں کبھی کبھار شارٹنر کے قریب بھی جانے کی طور نہیں پڑتی"},{"kind":"text","t":25703.902448,"text":"These days people write messages on computer screens; they sometimes don’t even need to go near a keyboard."},{"kind":"audio","t":25790.004175,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25795.287637999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25800.609979999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":25801.325448,"samples":1296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":25874.937962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":25880.002448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":25884.10844,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":39289.995059,"text":"دوسرے ممالک کے مسافروں کو بھاری ٹیکس دینے کا پابند کرکے بعض اوقات ماکول مقدار میں رقم بچائی جاسکتی ہے خاص طور پر تنباہ و اشراف جیسی مشروبات پر"},{"kind":"text","t":40189.459303999996,"text":"By forcing travelers from other countries to pay heavy taxes, a certain amount of money can sometimes be saved, especially on drinks like tobacco and alcohol."},{"kind":"audio","t":40303.336111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40308.455917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":40313.71909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40318.833005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40324.205747,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40329.275453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40334.707732999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40338.951863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":40339.248938,"samples":11456,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":44683.941583,"text":"پودے فوٹو سنتھیسز کے ذریعہ اپنا خانہ دھوپ میں بناتے ہیں وہ سایہ بھی مہیا کرتے ہیں"},{"kind":"text","t":45264.775983,"text":"Plants create their own homes in sunlight through photosynthesis; they also provide shade."},{"kind":"audio","t":45344.808041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45348.014247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45349.574492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45349.942876,"samples":13896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":45430.002663,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45432.682358,"samples":21832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":58612.164199,"text":"ہسپتال نے انفیکشن پر قابو پانے کیلئے پروٹوکول کی تقلید کی ہے جس میں مریض کو دیگر سے علیحدہ کرنا شامل ہے تاکہ دیگر افراد کے ممکنہ انفیکشن سے بچا جاسکے"},{"kind":"text","t":59431.858992,"text":"The hospital has followed protocols to control the infection, which include isolating the patient from others to prevent potential infection of other people."},{"kind":"audio","t":59543.463737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59548.71746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59554.17676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59559.590231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":59564.966652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59570.168616,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59575.509637999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59578.332410999996,"samples":31624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":67921.05966000001,"text":"انجام دیئے گئے زیادہ تر کام نظریاتی تھے لیکن وہ پروگرام برج کوس کی کہکشاں سے بنے مشاہدات کی معیاری نمونے کے لیے تحریر کیا گیا تھا"},{"kind":"text","t":68714.528426,"text":"Most of the work done was theoretical, but the program was written to create standard templates for observations from the Virgo galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":68811.64194100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68817.006762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":68822.17452700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68827.591287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68832.86333000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68838.229871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68841.09175400001,"samples":21792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":81034.92053500001,"text":"بارسلونا کی سرکاری زبانیں کٹالن اور اسپینش ہے تقریبا نصف لوگ کٹالن بولنے کو ترجیح دیتے ہیں زیادہ تر لوگ اس زبان کو سمجھتے ہیں اور عملی طور پر ہر ایک اسپینش جانتا ہے"},{"kind":"text","t":82019.79349800001,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. About half of the people prefer to speak Catalan. Most people understand this language, and practically everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":82105.838566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82111.003861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":82116.32747300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82118.81719100001,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"audio","t":82183.009711,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82188.334323,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82191.37607200001,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"audio","t":82264.69103100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82270.055202,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":82275.31981500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82280.674446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":82280.78839500001,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":85576.40587700001,"text":"کچھ علاقوں میں ایک منٹ کے لیے پانی موبائل نہ کافی ہے کچھ اور جگہوں پر بہت سے منٹ درکار ہیں"},{"kind":"text","t":86282.96512000001,"text":"In some areas, one minute of mobile data isn’t enough; in other places, many minutes are required."},{"kind":"audio","t":86374.82870200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86379.838149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86385.44818600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":86385.65282300001,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":86448.83498900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86454.01595300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86456.692959,"samples":21464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":95511.07886600001,"text":"فود قدرتی ماحول میں اپنے عروج پر ہوتے ہیں لہذا ان کا بس ایک نمونہ ہٹانے کی خواہش سے خود کو روکیں"},{"kind":"text","t":96171.717287,"text":"Food thrives in a natural environment, so just resist the urge to remove even a single sample."},{"kind":"audio","t":96261.82650800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96267.104451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":96272.34855400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96277.714376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96283.05717700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":96283.42809100001,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103403.49819700001,"text":"کے دوران زیادہ تر شہریوں اور قوموں کا غالب رویہ امن پسند تھی اور تنہائی پسندی تھی"},{"kind":"text","t":104000.01519800001,"text":"During that time, the prevailing attitude of most citizens and nations was peaceful and reclusive."},{"kind":"audio","t":104091.211171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":104094.184762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":104097.582896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104100.85509200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104104.179097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":104104.41864300001,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":112502.59075500001,"text":"مزاجرس اپنے وقت کا سب سے بڑا شکار خور تھا اس لیے وہ دیگر مزاجرس کے علاوہ کسی ضخائف نہیں ہوتا تھا"},{"kind":"text","t":113203.12939700001,"text":"Mazagers was the largest predator of its time, so it had no rivals other than other Mazagers."},{"kind":"audio","t":113294.35167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113299.451425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113304.6309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113309.983131,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":113315.48262000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":113315.813905,"samples":5360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":120203.271175,"text":"میں انیسویس کی بنیاد پیراگے اپنا دیسے کردار روشناک کو برقرار رکھنے میں کامیاب رہا"},{"kind":"text","t":120820.492954,"text":"I managed to maintain my character Roshanak by building upon Anivesh’s foundation."},{"kind":"audio","t":120910.166792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120915.436575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120920.608009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120926.07050900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120929.852197,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":125303.43555400001,"text":"یہ مرض پہلے سوٹ میں پیدا ہوتا ہے پھر مچھل اس کو انسانوں کو منتقل کرتے ہیں"},{"kind":"text","t":125734.48365000001,"text":"This disease originates in fish and is then transmitted to humans."},{"kind":"audio","t":125819.124221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125824.296036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":125829.755455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125833.764209,"samples":28296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":134616.591864,"text":"دور دراز علاقوں میں بیشتر جدید تحقیقی داربین کے ماحول دوست حالات کے ساتھ زبردست سہولیات موجود ہیں"},{"kind":"text","t":135206.874139,"text":"In remote areas, most modern research telescopes have excellent facilities along with environmentally friendly conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":135305.48702899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135310.770261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135316.305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135321.536624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":135326.533481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135331.967981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135335.313406,"samples":24792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":143214.534085,"text":"ممکن ہے کہ افراد دس امر کی توقع نہ رکھتے ہوں کہ گھر واپس جانے والے مسافروں کے لیے صبر اور سمجھ بوجھ بھی ضروری ہے"},{"kind":"text","t":143913.905986,"text":"It’s possible that people don’t expect ten things; patience and understanding are also essential for travelers returning home."},{"kind":"audio","t":144002.563431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144007.783725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144010.751716,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"audio","t":144094.465642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144099.666926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144104.930569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144110.45475799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":144110.812362,"samples":8128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147475.550583,"text":"تو یہ امکان ہے کہ علامت کو محض لیبل کے طور پر مشامل کیا گیا تھا"},{"kind":"text","t":147958.943604,"text":"So it’s possible that the symbol was included merely as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":148048.903077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148054.187599,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148059.81240599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148062.538171,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":154235.752546,"text":"لیکن ان چیڈیو کی نسبت سے بہت سی باتیں جو ڈائنوس اور جیسی لگتی ہیں"},{"kind":"text","t":154745.71546799998,"text":"But compared to those videos, many things seem like Dinosaurs and such."},{"kind":"audio","t":154831.947063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154836.95101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154842.469839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154846.735778,"samples":28296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":165044.16130399998,"text":"وہ تقریبا ریتیل ساحل ہیں جو تراکی کے لئے محفوظ ہیں اور زیادہ تر میں سایہ ہوتا ہے جو کہ بہت کعویٰ کے درخت فراہم کرتا ہے"},{"kind":"text","t":165713.23291599998,"text":"They are almost sandy beaches reserved for Turks, and most of them have shade provided by many palm trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":165812.005774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165817.19203799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":165822.297284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165827.657605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165832.920498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":165834.924075,"samples":17360,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":173269.88478599998,"text":"دو بڑے بچے کے والد شادی شدہ ڈیوال کے نے ملڑ کو بہت زیادہ متاثر نہیں کیا جن کے تعلق سے یہ کہانی تھی"},{"kind":"text","t":174132.238444,"text":"The married Dewal, who is the father of two older children, didn’t greatly affect Mulr, about whom this story was told."},{"kind":"audio","t":174232.640255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174237.895028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174243.22371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":174248.52750199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174254.186419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174259.607919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":174260.042222,"samples":9192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":184304.967808,"code":1005}]}